The data is a processed copy of statistics published on e-Stat (政府統計の総合窓口) by the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism (国土交通省, 水害統計調査).
It is offered under the terms of e-Stat, https://www.e-stat.go.jp/terms-of-use , which are based on the Government Standard Terms of Use version 2.0 and are stated to be compatible with CC BY 4.0.

Attribution (出典):
出典：政府統計の総合窓口(e-Stat)（https://www.e-stat.go.jp/）、国土交通省『水害統計調査』を加工して作成

The data was edited and reshaped; it was not made by the Government of Japan and must not be presented as if it were.
Third-party rights are not cleared by this notice. The scripts of this repository are offered as is.

